      en: ["The highest point is Birut at 5,670 meters", "Extends over a length of approximately 100 kilometers", "Forms the drainage divide between the Vanch and Yazgulem", "Geology consists of granite and crystallizing schists", "The region is known for its traditional mountain villages", "Contains numerous small slope glaciers"],
