      en: ["Ismoil Somoni Peak is the highest point at 7,495 meters above sea level.", "The range spans a total distance of approximately 110 kilometers.", "There are 24 peaks within the range that exceed an altitude of 6,000 meters.", "The 77-kilometer long Fedchenko Glacier is a prominent feature of the range.", "The range was officially named in 1927 after the Soviet Academy of Sciences.", "The geological composition includes granite and Paleozoic sedimentary rocks."],
